OL,3,GNEWSAYellow rainfall warning in place
OL,4,Afor parts of Northern Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rainfall warning has been issued for
OL,7,Fparts of Northern Ireland on Sunday,
OL,8,Fwith the potential for travel
OL,9,Fdisruption.
OL,11,FThe Met Office yellow alert, which
OL,12,Flasts until 14:00 BST, warns of intense
OL,13,Frainfall before conditions improve
OL,14,Fearly this afternoon.
OL,16,FThe organisation expects between
OL,17,F20-40mm of rain falling in just a few
OL,18,Fhours in some places, possibly causing
OL,19,Fsome disruption.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
